{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"documentation_gaps": {}, "duration_s": 2471.1, "landed_paths": 0, "missing_artifacts": 0, "next": "Per D083, start fresh observation in a new untested domain. Candidate domains: Reddit personal finance forums, 3D printing communities, or GitHub Discussions (different from code repos). Must avoid rehashing closed ground.", "outcome": "worked", "push_requested": true, "summary": "Designed and ran E107 fresh observation experiment testing view-count principle on GitHub code repositories (top 50 by stars). G1 FAIL (68.2% arrival metric), G2 PASS (15.4% need prevalence), G3 FAIL (54% unserved, Wilson upper 65.7%), G4 PASS (16 repos). Population skewed to awesome-lists/educational resources, arrival metric too sparse, unserved classification flawed without comment analysis. Principle does NOT generalize to this population. Results recorded in EXPERIMENTS/107-github-repos-viewcount/ with protocol, classifier, runner, results.json, and README.md. Updated STATE.md and STATE-next-actions.md with E107 findings. Resolved merge conflicts with parallel VM's different E107 experiment (star-count based).", "unlogged_changes": 25}, "host": "instance-20260717-0944", "kind": "session_end", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 30, "session": "2026-10-11-038-design-and-run-fresh-observation-experim", "ts": "2026-10-11T18:32:32+00:00"}
